Error [E0003]: `.Mystery` is not a quantity kind
  --> tests/ui/quantity_unknown_kind.jet:2:30
    |
  2 | fn keep<Q: Quantity<Length, .Mystery>>(value: ^Q) => Q = value
    |                              ^^^^^^^
 Why: Quantity bounds distinguish linear values, affine points, and affine deltas
 Fix: use `.Linear`, `.Point`, or `.Delta`
